Subject: [PATCH] feat: 'max' first-class auto-router alias + Model Tracker
 dashboard

- max: first-class alias of the built-in auto router (request entry point,
  both body.model and X-Route-Model header); max/<variant> maps to
  auto/<variant>
- /v1/models advertises 'max' alongside the auto/* catalog ids
- Model Tracker: new dashboard page (/dashboard/model-tracker) + API
  (/api/analytics/model-tracker) + db layer (src/lib/db/modelTracker.ts)
  showing per-model usage by request/token share and the auto/max router
  pick distribution, with time-range filter
- sidebar entry under Analytics
